{"t": "01:17:43", "kind": "answer", "slot": "dyn:danger_signs.breathing_difficulty+danger_signs.heavy_bleeding+complaint.category", "text": "No, he's breathing fine. No bleeding. He fell down 4 steps at home and landed on his right hip. He can't stand."}
